{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53419","headline":"临化示偈（题拟） · 无了","name":"临化示偈（题拟）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"八十年来辨东西（《五灯会元》作「西东」），如今不要白头公（《五灯会元》作「翁」）。\n非长非短非大小，还与诸人性相同。\n无来无去兼无住，了却本来自性空。\n（见《祖堂集》卷十五、《五灯会元》卷三）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"无了","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53419.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53419","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}